          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Auto-upgrade legacy GLSL ES 1.00 fragment source to GLSL ES 3.00. Default true - Shadertoy/ISF-style and modern 3.00 sources are both accepted. Set to false for strict 3.00 input, which turns legacy constructs into compile errors instead of silently rewriting them. Only the fragment source is upgraded: a 1.00-style glsl.vertex fails to compile as written."
        },
